    {
      "bbox": [
        238,
        1457,
        1509,
        1596
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In an accompanying Memorandum, the Board of Ethics has rendered an opinion in answer to communications of city employees concerning proposed purchases of real estate. This Executive Order relates to both real and personal property.",
